<li>Developments in the Rorschach Technique. Masuk ke dalam Jurnal Fields of Application, Volume 2.</li>
<li>The Rorschach Techniquean Introductory Manual.</li>
<li>The Rorschach Technique: A Manual for a Projective Method of Personality Diagnosis</li>
</ul>
